nr={r}_{0}+ut+\\frac{1}{2}a{t}^{2},\n$$\n\n \n\nwhere ${r}_{0}$ is the initial position of the particle and $u$ is its initial velocity.\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{r}_{0}=2i-4j,\\,u=3i-j,\\,a=-i+j.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the position vector of the particle after $t=6\\,\\text{min}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =(2i-4j)+(3i-j)(6)+\\frac{1}{2}(-i+j)(6)^{2} \\\\  & =(2i-4j)+(18i-6j)+18(-i+j) \\\\  & =(20i-10j)+(-18i+18j) \\\\  & =(2i+8j)\\,\\text{m}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the distance from the particle to the origin at this time is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r| & =|2i+8j| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+{8}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+64} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{68} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{17}\\,\\text{m}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388480 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388481 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388482 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388483 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388484 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388479 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388479 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388479 1079 #edb/ref 17592186388480 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388479 1080 #uuid "26ef82b9-317e-5c14-a35e-1de7fcba946d" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388480 1081 "2\\sqrt{17}\\,\\text{m}" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388480 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388480 1084 #uuid "f569ac07-df0e-5527-9b3e-47d71e03dd46" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388481 1081 "4\\sqrt{13}\\,\\text{m}" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388481 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388481 1084 #uuid "30feb053-b683-54f2-969d-deb8d00c6fc2" 13194139533463 17592