{1}{2}x+2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we proceed as usual. We start by drawing the corresponding straight line \n\n$$\ny=-\\frac{1}{2}x+2.\n$$\n\n Since the inequality involves a 'less than *or equal to*' sign, the line $y=-\\frac{1}{2}x+2$ itself is part of the solution. Therefore, we draw a **solid line**. \n\nThen, we need to decide whether to shade above or below the line. The inequality \n\n$$\ny\\le -\\frac{1}{2}x+2\n$$\n\n refers to the $y$-values that are *less than* or equal to those on the line $y=-\\frac{1}{2}x+2,$ so we shade *below* the line. \n\n![](images/8b/8b906cf167528f484109528a93732dc2b8d73558bb02f454bb520af87efde3c5.png)" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388862 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388863 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388862 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388864 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388862 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388865 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388862 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388866 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388862 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388867 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388862 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388862 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388862 1079 #edb/ref 17592186388863 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388862 1080 #uuid "6ed07d46-b98a-5fa7-9c22-1b406322df54" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388863 1081 "images/ec/ec99abbe475fc356cfd36415012fe1a6e8e611895452b8e7b0f3f1b8457d61d7.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388863 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388863 1084 #uuid "7a831251-1892-5348-acb0-08de00fc7410" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388864 1081 "images/80/801b9576f2c9840eac75479d8983eb8b12a8a1138da7bb361f417c14ffad6823.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388864 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388864 1084 #uuid "0b0f6713-