 1072 #uuid "ea4847f7-e663-5fb5-abcf-705c57877607" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388882 1074 "First, we convert the inequality into slope-intercept form:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x-2y & \\ge 6 \\\\ -2y & \\ge -3x+6 \\\\ y & \\le \\frac{3}{2}x-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we proceed as usual. We start by drawing the corresponding straight line \n\n$$\ny=\\frac{3}{2}x-3.\n$$\n\n Since the inequality involves a 'less than *or equal to*' sign, the line $y=\\frac{3}{2}x-3$ itself is part of the solution. Therefore, we draw a **solid line**.\n\nThen, we need to decide whether to shade above or below the line. The inequality \n\n$$\ny\\le \\frac{3}{2}x-3\n$$\n\n refers to the $y$-values that are *less than* or equal to those on the line $y=\\frac{3}{2}x-3,$ so we shade *below* the line.\n\n![](images/ea/ea12ed8d62304ecdc90859d5cd206045cef852522ce16c67a9307ddbd755b3dc.png)" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388883 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388884 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388883 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388885 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388883 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388886 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388883 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388887 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388883 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388888 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388883 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388883 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388883 1079 #edb/ref 17592186388885 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388883 1080 #uuid "e5ab8004-673e-5920-a0af-c5b35bc2a73c" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388884 1081 "images/f1/f18b75a1d71e01bd898e14a66bbec923abd988c72a8e9d69451c8edf1d16fc72.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388884 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388884 1084 #uuid "e5d1ab9e-6505-5ada-bb33-19f9bd4b6196" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [175921863888