9 1074 "To find the image of the triangle under the action of $T$, we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of the triangle:\n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under the action of $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -6 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-9 & -9 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the image's vertices are $(-9,3)$, $(-9,3),$ $(3,-1).$ Notice that all three points lie on the same line.\n\nSo, the image of our triangle under the action of $T$ is as follows:\n\n![](images/84/84edf48b555f43cfb4866b9798b03110a609c88e92e83ad1fca17a926718a67e.png)" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388890 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388891 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388890 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388892 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388890 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388893 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388890 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388894 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388890 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388895 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388890 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388890 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388890 1079 #edb/ref 17592186388895 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388890 1080 #uuid "a487c7ea-06dc-58aa-a36d-43a45051e3d3" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388891 1081 "images/4f/4fcb159117d6a3e3a2003e0d7e5611ba91c69399bded1830aca96a9a74fd092f.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388891 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388891 1084 #uuid "19cb6f60-ad52-57c8-9c89-d3f0205b2ffd" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388892 1081 "images/f2/f2aca56b6bdc527fb130951c73c7307b3f