\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under the action of $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the image's vertices are $(-2,2)$, $(-2,2),$ $(2,-2).$ Notice that all three points lie on the same line.\n\nSo, the image of our triangle under the action of $T$ is as follows:\n\n![](images/c6/c688b1ee540e732329e597fb97a0595f619dbc4ff0aad86b6a01f1bdb51ae66b.png)" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388904 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388905 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388904 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388906 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388904 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388907 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388904 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388908 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388904 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388909 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388904 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388904 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388904 1079 #edb/ref 17592186388907 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388904 1080 #uuid "775d1a18-d6fd-53fc-a27b-7894cbc4846a" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388905 1081 "images/95/95fbb1a2298ebc809303d6c57a8440483cdd65748b090ea0b45d25ebad93bb80.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388905 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388905 1084 #uuid "49c77e01-4d1d-5c06-a480-d447276bb1d7" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388906 1081 "images/8f/8f43f19bbe4213ba2f9d5bc51f52b747e1c7840a27607207f0ca56021c1914d5.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388906 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388906 1084 #uuid "b10b56d0-0de6-5d02-bddd-cf895c4147d0" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388907 1081 "images/c6/c688b1ee540e732329e597fb97a0595f619dbc4ff0aad86b6a01f1bdb51ae66b.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388907 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388907 1084 #uuid "c66d7895-934c-5bb8-97d5-8056fed90107" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388908 1081 "images/37/378a24a8553ac7092b85f715394bf632b5e87aaf45c58ce3ff7ae66310b28f65.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388908 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388908 1084 #uuid "beb8153f-9f67-5cdc-841a-d6318264c4dd" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388909 1081 "images/0f/0f0589a467b3d35947a6f501ff00d5296e05ae7e375800659986038db55c7577.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388909 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388909 1084 #uuid "2e5db3c4-68c8-55f4-9716-051a8b246d89" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388910 1068 #edb/ref 17592186388911 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388910 1069 "q-148199" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388910 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388910 1071 "Which of the following is equivalent to the integral ${\\int }_{C}({x}^{3}-2y)\\text{d}s,$ where $C$ is the section of the curve $y=2-\\frac{x}{2}$ for $\\,0\\le x\\le 2?$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388910 1072 #uuid "e7d9bec2-9225-5625-8a03-8734f22a69ef" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388910 1074 "Notice that the given curve is of the form $y=y(x).$ Therefore, by setting $x=t,$ we have $y=y(t)=2-\\frac{t}{2}.$ This gives the following parametrization of the curve:\n\n$$\nr(t)=⟨t,2-\\frac{t}{2}⟩,\\,0\\le t\\le 2\n$$\n\nComputing ${r}^{′}(t)$ and $‖{r}^{′}(t)‖,$ we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2-\\frac{t}{2})j \\\\  & =i-\\frac{1}{2}\\,j \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{(-\\frac{1}{2})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $f(x,y)={x}^{3}-2y$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(t)) & ={t}^{3}-2(2-\\frac{t}{2})={t}^{3}+t-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the integral as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}f(r(t))\\,‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}({t}^{3}+t-4)\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}\\cdot \\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}({t}^{3}+t-4)\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388911 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388912 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388911 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388913 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388911 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388914 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388911 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388915 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388911 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388916 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388911 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388911 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388911 1079 #edb/ref 17592186388916 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388911 1080 #uuid "92df483e-25e7-5869-98dd-8c3813ab168b" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388912 1081 "\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}({t}^{3}-t-4)\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388912 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388912 1084 #uuid "14ea8228-51e6-5f85-b539-c1d15c0fe792" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388913 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}(t-4)\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388913 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388913 1084 #uuid "860a0600-6c2c-5c9e-b5c4-9b17db189976" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388914 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}(2{t}^{3}+t-8)\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388914 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388914 1084 #uuid "23c91797-5d7f-5e12-aa9e-092abce95ff8" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388915 1081 "\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}({t}^{3}+2t-8)\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388915 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388915 1084 #uuid "463a4d0d-9541-5db1-8cdc-bef6635f6bdc" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388916 1081 "\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}({t}^{3}+t-4)\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388916 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388916 1084 #uuid "7b1c4954-271d-5c20-a752-fbf6f8daf6d1" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388917 1068 #edb/ref 17592186388918 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388917 1069 "q-148205" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388917 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388917 1071 "Which of the following is equivalent to the integral ${\\int }_{C}y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}s,$ where $C$ is the section of the curve $y=2{e}^{x}$ for $\\,0\\le x\\le 2?$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388917 1072 #uuid "d45e7151-1e23-5fc3-b354-b72fb9448af9" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388917 1074 "Notice that the given curve is of the form $y=y(x).$ Therefore, by setting $x=t,$ we have $y=y(t)=2{e}^{t}.$ This gives the following parametrization of the curve:\n\n$$\nr(t)=⟨t,2{e}^{t}⟩,\\,0\\le t\\le 2\n$$\n\nComputing ${r}^{′}(t)$ and $‖{r}^{′}(t)‖,$ we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2{e}^{t})j \\\\  & =i+2{e}^{t}\\,j \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+(2{e}^{t})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+4{e}^{2t}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $f(x,y)=y\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(t)) & =2{e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the integral as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}f(r(t))\\,‖{r}^{′}(t)‖\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}2{e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\cdot \\sqrt{1+4{e}^{2t}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{2}{e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\sqrt{1+4{e}^{2t}}\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388918 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388919 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388918 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388920 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388918 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388921 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388918 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388922 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388918 1075 #edb/ref 17592186388923 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388918 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388918 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388918 1079 #edb/ref 17592186388920 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388918 1080 #uuid "6a5a001a-2ddf-5fd9-a315-06e7e52536bf" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388919 1081 "{\\int }_{0}^{2}{e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\sqrt{1+4{e}^{2t}}\\,\\text{d}t" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388919 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388919 1084 #uuid "9ab06ac6-4b86-5107-beab-c84b66be2cbc" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186388920 1081 "