 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389007 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389007 1084 #uuid "04f3aa5b-1769-54da-88b9-15a178728381" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389008 1068 #edb/ref 17592186389009 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389008 1069 "q-158362" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389008 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389008 1071 "Find the orthogonal projection of the vector $x$ onto the plane $r=sv+tw,$ where $s,t\\in R,$ and\n\n$$\nv=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}],\\,w=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389008 1072 #uuid "51493b5e-5437-5dda-a56f-ba4f747b7597" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389008 1074 "First, notice that $v$ and $w$ are linearly independent. \n\nThe orthogonal projection of $x$ onto the subspace $S$ spanned by the columns of a matrix $A$ is given by\n\n$$\n{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x=A({A}^{T}\\,A)^{-1}\\,{A}^{T}\\,x.\n$$\n\nSince our plane passes through the origin, it defines the subspace $S=\\text{Span}{v,w}$ in ${R}^{3}.$ In our case, we have\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}| & | \\\\ v & w \\\\ | & |\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\,⟹\\,{A}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get the following projection:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {([\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}])}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {[\\begin{aligned}9 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot \\frac{1}{6}[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389009 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389010 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389009 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389011 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389009 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389012 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389009 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389013 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389009 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389014 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389009 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389009 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389009 1079 #edb/ref 17592186389014 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389009 1080 #uuid "45ddbeff-2df7-55fa-abb1-f8f4f1b0d152" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389010 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389010 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389010 1084 #uuid "59df8c83-20c2-59c0-bf86-ff91d435fad5" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389011 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389011 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389011 1084 #uuid "5859b576-61ad-5ce5-a21e-ba9d528365f0" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389012 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389012 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [175