592186389185 1081 "{\\int }_{-1}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{5}{\\int }_{1}^{4}{x}^{2}+xy+{z}^{2}\\,\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389185 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389185 1084 #uuid "9ece1154-32b4-5bbc-8f11-81891db833a7" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389186 1081 "{\\int }_{1}^{4}{\\int }_{0}^{5}{\\int }_{-1}^{3}{x}^{2}+xy+{z}^{2}\\,\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}z" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389186 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389186 1084 #uuid "2aa9da43-5b93-50a6-a625-5c6149bec690" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389187 1068 #edb/ref 17592186389188 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389187 1069 "q-161837" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389187 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389187 1071 "Which of the following shows the region in the $uv$-plane where the transformation $T,$ given by \n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}{u}^{3}+v \\\\ uv\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nis (locally) orientation-reversing?" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389187 1072 #uuid "c2f0da55-1926-59a4-96c8-e68855af7a42" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389187 1074 "Recall that a transformation is (locally) orientation-reversing at the points where the Jacobian determinant is negative:\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}<0\n$$\n\nWe have\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}{u}^{3}+v \\\\ uv\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nComputing the corresponding Jacobian determinant, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}{u}^{2} & 1 \\\\ v & u\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & ={u}^{2}\\cdot u-v\\cdot 1 \\\\  & ={u}^{3}-v.\\end{aligned}