n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(T) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-1)-4\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =2 \\\\  & \\ne 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have a non-singular matrix. \n\nTherefore, $T$ is invertible, and the image of the pentagon under the action of $T$ is a pentagon." 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389264 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389265 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389264 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389266 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389264 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389267 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389264 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389268 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389264 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389269 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389264 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389264 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389264 1079 #edb/ref 17592186389268 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389264 1080 #uuid "d1250926-eea3-55ee-b530-0094a4347a99" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389265 1081 "A square" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389265 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389265 1084 #uuid "e04b870d-e25b-5d96-b606-28a110148002" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389266 1081 "A point" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389266 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389266 1084 #uuid "062427a9-0f48-53fc-94f1-c6c3d5e866d8" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389267 1081 "A triangle" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389267 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389267 1084 #uuid "b7b5ad5a-830d-59fb-be20-4b48087915f5" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389268 1081 "A pentagon" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389268 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389268 1