45585 true] [17592186389305 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389305 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389305 1079 #edb/ref 17592186389307 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389305 1080 #uuid "e17095f8-ba86-50e5-a8b1-f267ffaff592" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389306 1081 "images/59/59cc6771efc546ca0b6ff4fe7b9fd7a1e7794c20240052c3d8e4e29ad114ec8d.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389306 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389306 1084 #uuid "8698d81c-07f1-58ee-9dd6-e41a3eaa29dc" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389307 1081 "images/d8/d8a917138beb862f6816fc059847659b1ba11e17d6a7a4906309b021baf1d3e5.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389307 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389307 1084 #uuid "07eaee6d-65d6-5afc-9448-c3466e6e1563" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389308 1081 "images/f1/f15f43e3663cfee8328135cb30894c4f268004f4bb74c838cb1bbf2c654c19f9.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389308 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389308 1084 #uuid "b0cc1df6-2564-53f0-b5cb-5a4e1d5c3a28" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389309 1081 "images/b4/b4510002c6e424de6ea16f3037237ea9628b0ddd61f7fa4643d412b66b4fd749.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389309 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389309 1084 #uuid "5834d494-4bff-53e7-8745-4b2b513b127b" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389310 1081 "images/05/0525436f0f1ea9283c783bf590ae6dd58408ba5d5e2e6f69fc83af86e470864d.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389310 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389310 1084 #uuid "1bf18620-f54f-5e1e-8a0a-daf6f078a0ca" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389311 1068 #edb/ref 17592186389312 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389311 1069 "q-162376" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389311 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389311 1071 "![](images/c7/c72489a2d33a181fe7bc07d5cc017b93daccac51889cbb61edd64d4ee34429df.png)\n\nThe triple integral of $f(x,y,z)$ over the region $R$ (shown above) can be expressed as the following repeated integral:\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}+1}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y\n$$\n\nRewrite this repeated integral by integrating first with respect to $z,$ then $y,$ and then $x.$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389311 1072 #uuid "7b94d854-420e-5d57-988d-2367c6e7514b" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389311 1074 "From the given repeated integral, we see that $R$ can be written as a type I region as follows:\n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le \\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}},\\,\\,0\\le z\\le \\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}+1}\n$$\n\nWe wish to rewrite our triple integral as follows:\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{a}^{b}{\\int }_{{v}_{1}(x)}^{{v}_{2}(x)}{\\int }_{{u}_{1}(x,y)}^{{u}_{2}(x,y)}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nSince both repeated integrals first integrate with respect to $z,$ the $z$-limits remain the same as before:\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{a}^{b}{\\int }_{{v}_{1}(x)}^{{v}_{2}(x)}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}+1}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nNow, we consider the projection $D$ of $R$ onto the $xy$-plane shown below.\n\n![](images/98/98aa4c0a436e4649ccd3d48a53fbf94b0341bf30b95745c4d052381680d223cf.png)\n\nThe region $D$ is a type II region in the $xy$-plane:\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le y\\le 1,\\,\\,0\\le x\\le \\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}}\n$$\n\nTo change the order of integration from $\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y$ to $\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x,$ we write $D$ as a type I region.\n\nNotice that the top boundary of the region, written in the form $y=y(x),$ is \n\n$$\nx=\\sqrt{1-{y}^{2}}\\,⟹\\,y=\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}\n$$\n\nand the bottom boundary of the region is\n\n$$\ny=0.\n$$\n\nThen, the type I representation of the region $D$ is\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le x\\le 1,\\,\\,0\\le y\\le \\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}},\n$$\n\nas shown below.\n\n![](images/47/47380c108c5b271761de2a027399bbd5981f2a9bdff21e498d73d0b430d070c7.png)\n\nTherefore, by swapping the order of integration, we obtain\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}+1}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389313 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389314 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389315 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389316 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389312 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389317 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389312 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389312 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389312 1079 #edb/ref 17592186389315 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389312 1080 #uuid "0507eef8-6716-508b-a842-3c8bdf5c1848" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389313 1081 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{1}^{{x}^{2}}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}+1}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389313 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389313 1084 #uuid "cf649ac9-021b-5cf3-967e-e46b117c455d" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389314 1081 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}z\\,\\