and $y$ are measured in meters.\nFind the moment of inertia of the plate about a line perpendicular to $D$ at a distance of $\\sqrt{6}\\,\\text{m}$ from a parallel line passing through its center of mass." 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389496 1072 #uuid "677a6071-7ce4-5abc-a513-660a8ad8e603" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389496 1074 "For a plane lamina of mass $M$ and a line ${l}_{M}$ perpendicular to the lamina passing through its center of mass, the parallel axis theorem states that the moment of inertia of the lamina about a line $l$ parallel to ${l}_{M}$ is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{l}={I}_{M}+{d}^{2}M,\n$$\n\nwhere $d$ is the distance between the lines, and ${I}_{M}$ and ${I}_{l}$ are the moments of inertia about the lines ${l}_{M}$ and $l,$ respectively.\n\nThe area of the rectangular plate $D$ is $A=2\\cdot 2=4\\,{\\text{m}}^{2}.$\nSince the plate has a uniform density, the mass density function is given by\n\n$$\n\\lambda (x,y)=\\frac{M}{A}=\\frac{(\\frac{3}{2})}{4}=\\frac{3}{8}\\,\\text{kg}/{\\text{m}}^{2},\n$$\n\nand its center of mass is its centroid:\n\n$$\n(\\overset{¯}{x},\\overset{¯}{y})=(\\frac{-1+1}{2},\\frac{0+2}{2})=(0,1)\n$$\n\nThen, the moment of inertia about the perpendicular line through the center of mass is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{M} & ={∬}_{D}((x-\\overset{¯}{x})^{2}+(y-\\overset{¯}{y})^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}3{x}^{2}+3(y-1)^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}{[3{x}^{2}y+(y-1)^{3}]}_{y=0}^{y=2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}6{x}^{2}+2\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}{[2{x}^{3}+2x]}_{-1}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}(2+2-(-2-2)) \\\\  & =1\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, applying the parallel axis theorem, the moment of inertia about a line $\\sqrt{6}\\,\\text{m}$ from the center of mass is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & ={I}_{M}+{d}^{2}M \\\\  & =1+{(\\sqrt{6})}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{3}{2} \\\\  & =1+9 \\\\  & =10\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389497 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389497 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389497 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389500 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389497 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389501 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389497 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389502 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389497 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389497 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389497 1079 #edb/ref 17592186389500 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389497 1080 #uuid "525e80e6-2970-531f-b670-bb348fa022c2" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389498 1081 "\\frac{21}{2}\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389498 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389498 1084 #uuid "f162c583-fe62-5fba-9c96-68bf896663bb" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389499 1081 "\\frac{15}{2}\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389499 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389499 1084 #uuid "64cf8fe1-66d9-5ab3-8251-577ddc7a7669" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389500 1081 "10\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389500 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389500 1084 #uuid "9d91dbe3-c6c4-5402-85f2-5aebe1228361" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389501 1081 "12\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389501 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389501 1084 #uuid "0a2b9d9e-a55d-5269-90e7-268bfa853936" 13194139533463 17592186