ligned}{I}_{M} & ={∬}_{D}((x-\\overset{¯}{x})^{2}+(y-\\overset{¯}{y})^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}((x-2)^{2}+(y-1)^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{2}((x-2)^{2}+(y-1)^{2})2x\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{2}2x(x-2)^{2}+2x(y-1)^{2}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}{[2x(x-2)^{2}y+\\frac{2}{3}x(y-1)^{3}]}_{y=0}^{y=2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}4x(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{4}{3}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}4{x}^{3}-16{x}^{2}+16x+\\frac{4}{3}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}4{x}^{3}-16{x}^{2}+\\frac{52}{3}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[{x}^{4}-\\frac{16}{3}{x}^{3}+\\frac{26}{3}{x}^{2}]}_{0}^{3} \\\\  & =81-144+78-0 \\\\  & =15\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, applying the parallel axis theorem, the moment of inertia about a line $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\,\\text{m}$ from the center of mass is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & ={I}_{M}+{d}^{2}M \\\\  & =15+{(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3})}^{2}\\cdot 18 \\\\  & =15+4 \\\\  & =19\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389504 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389505 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389504 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389506 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389504 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389507 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389504 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389508 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389504 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389509 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389504 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389504 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389504 1079 #edb/ref 17592186389505 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389504 1080 #uuid "647cfa17-f0ad-5abd-9877-f316086b5810" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389505 1081 "19\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] 