 true] [17592186389800 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389800 1084 #uuid "ef857f1a-d365-55c1-9f94-4a0e4c46efc1" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389801 1081 "images/ef/efa51ca7fcb2e24c5f7a77114a7accb008696dd012d60307937c26c1039e6892.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389801 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389801 1084 #uuid "88e6a03c-020e-515c-97ad-a0dbc44a2bc3" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389802 1081 "images/de/de4621c16bad151116f6c6fa4b197c6207b527bff90e5f9c857405ca3e6b135d.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389802 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389802 1084 #uuid "8944f4c5-55a9-51e1-a1e9-7dc77668ffb5" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389803 1068 #edb/ref 17592186389804 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389803 1069 "q-177648" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389803 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389803 1071 "Let $I=[0,1]⊂R$ and ${X}_{i}=[0,i]\\times [0,1].$ Which of the following represents ${⋂}_{i\\in I}{X}_{i}?$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389803 1072 #uuid "60baa69f-bbf2-5905-831d-ab5e879fa2f0" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389803 1074 "Recall that the intersection of a family of indexed sets consists of those elements that belong to *all* the sets:\n\n$$\n{⋂}_{i\\in I}{A}_{i}={x\\,:\\,x\\in {A}_{k}\\,\\,\\text{for all}\\,\\,k\\in I}\n$$\n\nLet's now write down one of our indexed sets. For example, if $i=0.5,$ we have \n\n$$\n{X}_{0.5}=[0,0.5]\\times [0,1]={(a,b)\\,:\\,a\\in [0,0.5],b\\in [0,1]}.\n$$\n\nThis represents a rectangle whose vertices are at $(0,0),$ $(0.5,0),$ $(0.5,1),$ and $(0,1)$ in the coordinate plane, as shown below.\n\n![](images/5b/5b882f3fb0e7b44eb2df3a510260574e5c4a4d85842a9c0d65515f1a40894756.png)\n\nIn general,\n\n$$\n{X}_{i}=[0,i]\\times [0,1]={(a,b)\\,:\\,a\\in [0,i],b\\in [0,1]}\n$$\n\nis the rectangle whose vertices are at $(0,0),$ $(i,0),$ $(i,1),$ and $(0,1).$\n\n![](images/cb/cb530698591dbd71a8058d9faa0c60b636dc654f21e92d65ec8295aeaa67355a.png)\n\nThe intersection of all these rectangles is the line segment ${0}\\times [0,1]:$\n\n![](images/70/704f8f6f0666d09bb2b8a25eab0548c3eb808e2c9d394d2ae873de35cb0112d1.png)" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389804 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389805 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389804 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389806 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389804 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389807 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389804 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389808 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389804 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389809 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389804 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389804 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389804 1079 #edb/ref 17592186389806 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389804 1080 #uuid "f376ba00-5dab-590e-a791-4441f99a66cf" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389805 1081 "images/c8/c87871c50b343792c73fc18dfe92bc2065b18ed3de1e7bb70324b8b43d027206.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389805 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389805 1084 #uuid "c00cf5df-4240-5b04-850f-1b4b0d6f8ae1" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389806 1081 "images/39/39db7bc1b259b222a2365441babc3421101961ea26a7143af14b526ba7f81200.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389806 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389806 1084 #uuid "1f633a02-8088-56db-88c2-7889ba264321" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389807 1081 "images/ec/ec0e1df36bf5d93b8cdbcc3d14cd510fbe299b929ed3d19f4d901f4461093305.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389807 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 175921