$ to the point $(i,i).$ \n\n![](images/b9/b926204a3d58b25889f1c79dd0f65c1ea990c67bc88e869004396a77970e8dd4.png)\n\nAs $i$ runs over $I,$ these line segments sweep the following triangle that represents the union ${⋃}_{i\\in I}{X}_{i}:$\n\n![](images/4a/4a81de1a698eedf6a636d66b68a7c62efa69d1d026a961ae97ab5ecc2ef9828d.png)" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389811 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389812 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389811 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389813 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389811 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389814 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389811 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389815 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389811 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389816 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389811 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389811 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389811 1079 #edb/ref 17592186389815 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389811 1080 #uuid "6a3b75ec-dbba-566e-adfa-fb7b15c6d5b5" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389812 1081 "images/aa/aaa04c2578557d03dd144c27e6a5c223126830ba2a3f8288adc9239daf604e55.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389812 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389812 1084 #uuid "b35462e3-d90d-5229-9bb7-a180bdbea833" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389813 1081 "images/98/98077ef737a2487f9e480b7ffd42376785c5681e2651b98e7b71abb4e645d876.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389813 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389813 1084 #uuid "32da30c7-4f73-5968-bd10-234d5aa6eb9d" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389814 1081 "images/36/36b36ac05cb1054e198f2e40a2d0ffdd40e952abaa8ddf5c946a38fde946adc8.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389814 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389814 1084 #uuid "94b8b364-2f47-562b-be4f-8d6d5b53993c" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389815 1081 "images/4a/4a81de1a698eedf6a636d66b68a7c62efa69d1d026a961ae97ab5ecc2ef9828d.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389815 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389815 1084 #uuid "1da4c351-345b-51fc-b9bc-106b693a793a" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389816 1081 "images/74/749f4fb3a6416147cdd69c08bf806c28e2112929453bb8ae405c48452d82126b.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389816 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389816 1084 #uuid "f684dbe0-2990-5f82-837b-23d70335f3f3" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389817 1068 #edb/ref 17592186389818 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389817 1069 "q-177651" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389817 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389817 1071 "Let $I=[0,1]⊂R$ and ${X}_{i}=[-i,i]\\times {2i}.$ Which of the following represents ${⋃}_{i\\in I}{X}_{i}?$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389817 1072 #uuid "f0ade82f-e346-52ab-87f9-cb9aa1c85b6d" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389817 1074 "Recall that the union of a family of indexed sets consists of those elements that belong to *at least one* set:\n\n$$\n{⋃}_{i\\in I}{A}_{i}={x\\,:\\,x\\in {A}_{k}\\,\\,\\text{for at least one}\\,\\,k\\in I}\n$$\n\nLet's now write down one of our indexed sets. For example, if $i=0.5,$ we have \n\n$$\n{X}_{0.5}=[-0.5,0.5]\\times {1}={(k,1)\\,:\\,k\\in [-0.5,0.5]}.\n$$\n\nThis represents a horizontal line segment from the point $(-0.5,1)$ to the point $(0.5,1)$ in the coordinate plane, as shown below.\n\n![](images/6c/6c6aafd9ea78868e953340eaab3862491d275972d690e2ceb27c213dadbcaea6.png)\n\nIn general,\n\n$$\n{X}_{i}=[-i,i]\\times {2i}={(k,2i)\\,:\\,k\\in [-i,i]}\n$$\n\nis the horizontal line segment from the point $(-i,2i)$ to the point $(i,2i).$ \n\n![](images/02/02c8f93a25d7b510d3e238e6d4a974d6ccc2e83f3ac01fe92ce4535fbb4dce48.png)\n\nAs $i$ runs over $I,$ these line segments sweep the following triangle that represents the union ${⋃}_{i\\in I}{X}_{i}:$\n\n![](images/3b/3b3cefa03d71d99e4b7f3b6852ed36512d2a841a37c558034eac5c4b6870799c.png)" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389818 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389819 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389818 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389820 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389818 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389821 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389818 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389822 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389818 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389823 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389818 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389818 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389818 1079 #edb/ref 17592186389822 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389818 1080 #uuid "6201decc-d007-5bcc-852b-b1b8b5bc7b28" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389819 1081 "images/26/26e4af1684065b2127b0d9ec33632128f62a3b2b3aa772b48062ed23708b1b7d.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389819 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389819 1084 #uuid "af8829ea-eabd-5fae-9578-d03488cfc3af" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389820 1081 "images/2f/2f3d6fcce069f0b7b7918481b4cda68ba16fbb94dbf3ebe6b6841256470b84ea.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389820 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389820 1084 #uuid "1a0a9aea-b6fe-56e1-a8a9-e3ac81332f35" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389821 1081 "images/db/db4bea7c2f08abb66318443c88a0504bbfdc3d9597b3f42a8808795ebc78b172.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389821 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389821 1084 #uuid "a269d017-1375-58cf-b810-de5eeec9412c" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389822 1081 "images/3b/3b3cefa03d71d99e4b7f3b6852ed36512d2a841a37c558034eac5c4b6870799c.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389822 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389822 1084 #uuid "e387bc96-400f-584b-a615-edb0551b66e6" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389823 1081 "images/a1/a156cbc15d6841b1d661b77c3b2cf7e6459246e20653da5e461cc6446aded4c6.png" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389823 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389823 1084 #uuid "fcb67f6a-535a-53df-a825-cfba0db7f11b" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389824 1068 #edb/ref 17592186389825 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389824 1069 "q-1781" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389824 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389824 1071 "How many different ways can a group of four be made from a room of eighty people?" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389824 1072 #uuid "4bfaea9e-ab13-55ff-a72c-f7e351269ac2" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389824 1074 "In general, the number of combinations of $n$ objects taken $r$ at a time is given by the formula\n\n$$\n{}_{n}{C}_{r}=\\frac{n!}{(n-r)!\\,r!}.\n$$\n\nThere are $80$ people, so $n=80.$ We want to select $4$ of those people for each group, so we have $r=4.$\n\nTherefore, the number of different potential groups of four is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{}_{80}{C}_{4} & =\\frac{80!}{(80-4)!\\,4!} \\\\  & =\\frac{80!}{76!4!} \\\\  & =\\frac{80\\cdot 79\\cdot 78\\cdot 77\\cdot \\cancel{76!}}{\\cancel{76!}4!} \\\\  & =\\frac{80\\cdot 79\\cdot 78\\cdot 77}{4\\cdot 3\\cdot 2\\cdot 1} \\\\  & =\\frac{37\\,957\\,920}{24} \\\\  & =1\\,581\\,580.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389825 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389826 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186389825 1075 #edb/ref 17592186389827 13194139533463 17592186045585 tru