$$\n\n- Occurrence II of the variable $x$ is *bound* since it lies within the scope of the quantifier $∃x$ that uses $x:$\n\n$$\n∃\\,x\\in R,\\,\\overset{\\text{scope of }∃x}{\\overset{⏞}{2-{x}_{\\begin{aligned} \\\\ ↑ \\\\ \\text{b}\\end{aligned}}=w}}\n$$\n\n- Occurrence III of the variable $w$ is *free* since it isn't placed right next to a quantifier and it doesn't lie within the scope of a quantifier that uses $w.$\n\nThe occurrences of variables in the expression are as follows:\n\n$$\n∃{x}_{\\begin{aligned} \\\\ ↑ \\\\ \\text{b}\\end{aligned}}\\in R,\\,2-{x}_{\\begin{aligned} \\\\ ↑ \\\\ \\text{b}\\end{aligned}}={w}_{\\begin{aligned} \\\\ ↑ \\\\ \\text{f}\\end{aligned}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the free occurrence is \"III only.\"" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390212 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390213 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390212 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390214 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390212 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390215 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390212 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390216 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390212 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390217 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390212 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390212 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390212 1079 #edb/ref 17592186390215 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390212 1080 #uuid "5c76159e-4765-5e78-b848-edf1963706a1" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390213 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390213 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390213 1084 #uuid "7f9d353d-65eb-5da3-aee7-94de17e15ccd" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390214 1081 "I only" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390214 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390214 1084 #uuid "2f86a433-c584-57f5-bc5b-0e6c2efc7647" 13194139533463