ue] [17592186390354 1084 #uuid "5f99cbb1-2bbb-59be-947b-044557644091" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390355 1081 "⟨-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{77}},-\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{77}},-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{77}}⟩" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390355 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390355 1084 #uuid "1a526c30-a852-56c6-b14c-c2025f540361" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390356 1081 "⟨\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{74}},\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{74}},\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{74}}⟩" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390356 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390356 1084 #uuid "ab385b24-8ef8-5f1a-bd08-498b2099ce33" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390357 1081 "⟨\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{77}},\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{77}},\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{77}}⟩" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390357 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390357 1084 #uuid "585a8c8c-14a7-54a3-b24f-e4f0fbf0ee6e" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390358 1081 "⟨-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{74}},\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{74}},\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{74}}⟩" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390358 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390358 1084 #uuid "353305b2-1bf3-530e-9fe4-e18cf98ffcba" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390359 1068 #edb/ref 17592186390360 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390359 1069 "q-19532" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390359 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390359 1071 "Calculate $\\int \\frac{10}{|x-6|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-12x+35}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390359 1072 #uuid "db8ef128-2717-5091-8870-85aa35ff95e0" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390359 1074 "First, we complete the square for the expression inside the square root:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-12x+35 & ={x}^{2}-2\\cdot 6x+({6}^{2}-{6}^{2})+35 \\\\  & =({x}^{2}-12x+36)-36+35 \\\\  & =(x-6)^{2}-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above in the given integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{10}{|x-6|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-12x+35}}\\,\\text{d}x=10\\int \\frac{1}{|x-6|\\sqrt{(x-6)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nThis resembles the basic integral for inverse secant:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}\\,u+C\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $x-6.$\n\nSo, let's perform the substitution \n\n$$\nu=x-6.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nFinally, we write the integral in terms of $u,$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{10}{|x-6|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-12x+35}}\\,\\text{d}x & =10\\int \\frac{1}{|x-6|\\sqrt{(x-6)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =10\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =10\\,\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =10\\,\\text{arcsec}(x-6)+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390360 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390361 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390360 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390362 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390360 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390363 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390360 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390364 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390360 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390365 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390360 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390360 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390360 1079 #edb/ref 17592186390361 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390360 1080 #uuid "4529ba01-864b-583e-ae2f-75a351bb79bc" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390361 1081 "10\\,\\text{arcsec}(x-6)+C" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390361 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390361 1084 #uuid "dd564d9f-63fb-590f-bd58-4b804a9ab1e3" 13194139533463 17