es of $2\\pi $ to $2\\pi $:\n\n- $2\\pi +2\\pi =4\\pi \\,✓$\n\n- $2\\pi +2\\cdot (2\\pi )=6\\pi $\n\nOf the given values, there is no angle greater than $6\\pi .$ So, we can stop there.\n\nNow, let's subtract multiples of $2\\pi $ from $2\\pi $:\n\n- $2\\pi -2\\pi =0$\n\n- $2\\pi -2\\cdot (2\\pi )=-2\\pi \\,✓$\n\nOf the given angles, only $4\\pi $ and $-2\\pi $ are coterminal with $2\\pi .$\n\nSo the correct answer is I and III only." 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390448 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390449 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390448 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390450 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390448 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390451 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390448 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390452 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390448 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390453 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390448 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390448 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390448 1079 #edb/ref 17592186390450 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390448 1080 #uuid "323d55c4-1afd-5a97-b428-98053114cd7d" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390449 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390449 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390449 1084 #uuid "d432b851-5f5b-5ae5-be26-4e0689222795" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390450 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390450 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390450 1084 #uuid "f2d89b72-0360-5da3-ade1-fefd132aa0d9" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390451 1081 "I only" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390451 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390451 1084 #uuid "577f3889-2b45-5558-904e-e2cbac624263" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390452 1081 "I