ients) is *homogeneous* if the forcing function is zero. Otherwise, it is *inhomogeneous.*\n\nLet's classify the relation ${a}_{n}={a}_{n-1}^{2}-2{a}_{n-2}.$\n\n- The largest index difference between ${a}_{n}$ and the preceding terms ${a}_{n-1}$ and ${a}_{n-2}$ in the relation is $2.$ So, the relation has order $2.$\n\n- The term ${a}_{n-1}$ is not in the first power. So, the relation is non-linear.\n\nTherefore, the recurrence relation ${a}_{n}$ has order\n$2$ and is\n$\\text{non-linear}.$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390513 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390514 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390513 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390515 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390513 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390516 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390513 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390513 1077 "field-1" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390513 1079 #edb/ref 17592186390515 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390513 1080 #uuid "73f0e00d-e20e-5982-94a6-5289f5aa4b11" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390514 1081 "3" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390514 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390514 1084 #uuid "a70412e4-2e2f-509d-b258-df889378ed00" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390515 1081 "2" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390515 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390515 1084 #uuid "2705c2a3-8a66-5c84-a42d-4a3bc20f8cc6" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390516 1081 "1" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390516 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390516 1084 #uuid "978fdd34-d68a-507b-97a8-caec50bc0c8a" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390517 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390518 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390517 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390519 13194139533463 17592186045585 true]