[17592186390625 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390625 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390625 1079 #edb/ref 17592186390628 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390625 1080 #uuid "ea72c7cf-4601-57a4-9209-a10d3c1d61c5" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390626 1081 "v(3)=⟨162,\\,-3⟩" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390626 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390626 1084 #uuid "3d802366-8c74-530e-bca4-0a7897af9591" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390627 1081 "v(3)=⟨-3,\\,4⟩" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390627 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390627 1084 #uuid "9b2b9281-2486-508a-a086-5791a4da1ad4" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390628 1081 "v(3)=⟨159,\\,1⟩" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390628 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390628 1084 #uuid "51135115-c8f6-5cb8-9caa-6ed0f415e864" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390629 1081 "v(3)=⟨6,\\,-3⟩" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390629 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390629 1084 #uuid "3f22d450-0a0d-5d31-a431-6242452be5e2" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390630 1081 "v(3)=⟨162,\\,1⟩" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390630 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390630 1084 #uuid "cf9c67ed-d74b-5bfd-8830-80bbf2fd8b9a" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390631 1068 #edb/ref 17592186390632 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390631 1069 "q-31676" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390631 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390631 1071 "The velocity vector $v=⟨u,v⟩$ of a particle $P$ at time $t$ is given by\n\n$$\nv=⟨2{t}^{2}-4t,5t-{t}^{3}⟩.\n$$\n\nCalculate the acceleration vector $a$ at time $t=2.$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390631 1072 #uuid "d8e194cc-a3ff-5b1a-9395-33367dd7b040" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390631 1074 "To compute the acceleration vector, we differentiate the velocity vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2{t}^{2}-4t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(5t-{t}^{3})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4t-4,\\,5-3{t}^{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, to find the acceleration at time $t=2,$ we substitute $t=2$ into the above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(2) & =⟨4(2)-4,\\,5-3(2)^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨8-4,\\,5-12⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,-7⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390633 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390634 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390635 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390636 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390632 1075 #edb/ref 17592186390637 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390632 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390632 1077 "selection" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390632 1079 #edb/ref 17592186390635 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390632 1080 #uuid "ce3fed73-d6f3-5702-8279-92ba9653d466" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390633 1081 "a(2)=⟨0,-7⟩" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390633 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390633 1084 #uuid "32546fdd-a7bc-5f44-adbe-7fccc7018419" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390634 1081 "a(2)=⟨4,2⟩" 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390634 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533463 17592186045585 true] [17592186390634 1084 #uuid "c5f3fe1e-8647-5528-ac28-841fd6aed